Settings icons
==============

The .svg files in svg/ are Material Symbols (Rounded, filled, 48px) by Google,
https://fonts.google.com/icons, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The .png files are generated
from them by tools/gen_icons.py (white glyph on transparent background,
tinted by the application at draw time).
